### Check Status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/driver/status

### Add Trip 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/driver/trip
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "pickupLocation": "Alexandria VA",
    "dropoffLocation": "Reagan Airport",
    "distanceMiles": 5.2,
    "estimatedEarnings": 14.50,
    "durationMinutes": 18
}

